{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And to the cattle</b> — three tagin on the qof: to teach that there were three animals, and by this merit a son was given to the one hundred (ק\"ו) year old." "<b>And to the cattle ran</b> — the letters of אל הקבר רץ (\"to the grave running\"): he ran after him to the cave. ואל הבקר רץ — in gematria: רץ למערה (\"running to the cave\")."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:19.843758204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}